{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"rlc-circuit-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"sv","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"sv","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Vid resonans har en idealisk serie RLC minsta impedans lika med R; en idealisk parallell RLC har maximal impedans lika med R. Ström- och spänningsbeteendet skiljer sig därför åt även om ideal f₀ är densamma.","record_id":"70752a6809e70271ec3a1580ed8d69d4092de17b414de7163b37784925c22de3","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":1.3205459691249644,"source":"At resonance, an ideal series RLC has minimum impedance equal to R; an ideal parallel RLC has maximum impedance equal to R. Current and voltage behavior therefore differ even though ideal f₀ is the same.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"a0027fb9c91e4376b4b288a1bf0485cb799a4f5fc2a2d349880e24e09cd01b09","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Vid resonans har en idealisk serie RLC minsta impedans lika med R; en idealisk parallell RLC har maximal impedans lika med R. Ström- och spänningsbeteendet skiljer sig därför åt även om ideal f₀ är densamma.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
